erage cannot exceed 100%.","threshold_boundary":"The evidence level is selected before package generation, embedded in the integrity-bound protocol, and cannot change during scoring. Its limits are engineering gates, not clinical HRV normal ranges or standards-conformity criteria."},"verdict_scope":"per_case"}